{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_AD80DD92","title":"Finn","entry":"Dlg_AD80DD92::entry","exit":"Dlg_AD80DD92::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_0CC6F4F3","articyId":"72057778721544435","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"My guy, my gal, my planetary pal. Wow, is it great to see you.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My guy, my gal, my planetary pal. Wow, is it great to see you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":225.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51325","byteOffset":33831240,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_1E485DE3","articyId":"72057778721544450","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Come on! You know why! We ride the vibes together and we ride 'em high. Wait... was that you? It could have been... I think?","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Come on! You know why! We ride the vibes together and we ride 'em high. Wait... was that you? It could have been... I think?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":825.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31992","byteOffset":19984704,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_D3906E16","articyId":"72057778721544484","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Oh... Hmmmmm. Well, we can just ride the good ride now. Every night's a good night if you have the right vibe.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh... Hmmmmm. Well, we can just ride the good ride now. Every night's a good night if you have the right vibe.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49351","byteOffset":33013176,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_63AAB1E7","articyId":"72057778721544492","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"It is, it is! I tell yah. Anyway, what are you doing here? Wandering around?","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It is, it is! I tell yah. Anyway, what are you doing here? Wandering around?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30395","byteOffset":19379832,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_49E90202","articyId":"72057778721544499","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Every night's a good night if you have the right vibe.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Every night's a good night if you have the right vibe.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37045","byteOffset":28356784,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_A8893968","articyId":"72057778721544520","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Ugghhh, yeahhhh. That's a pass for me. Sorry but that's not the vibe I want to get with.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ugghhh, yeahhhh. That's a pass for me. Sorry but that's not the vibe I want to get with.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2050.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40467","byteOffset":29637176,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_C39839CB","articyId":"72057778721544543","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Eh, I just can't get behind the way the resort owners treat the androids they got working for em, you know? Doesn't seem right to help em get richer.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Eh, I just can't get behind the way the resort owners treat the androids they got working for em, you know? Doesn't seem right to help em get richer.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2650.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30810","byteOffset":19536600,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_984F87F4","articyId":"72057778721544572","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Oh, boo, bad shit man, bad shit. Pfft, get outta here with that.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, boo, bad shit man, bad shit. Pfft, get outta here with that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3250.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22178","byteOffset":16276024,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_16A29D3C","articyId":"72057778721544580","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Huh, I guess that's fair. Plus I could tip 'em pretty big too. People that dance on those beaches go home to swim in pools filled with Lims.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh, I guess that's fair. Plus I could tip 'em pretty big too. People that dance on those beaches go home to swim in pools filled with Lims.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3250.0,"y":32